# Leaks LeakSanitizer reports inside libraries, for the asan test presets. Each line names
# a library or a vendored library's function, never a function of ours, so a leak in our
# code always fails (A03).
# A window opens through GLFW and libdecor, whose fonts leak:
leak:libfontconfig.so
# Where no display answers, GLFW unloads libX11 after XInitThreads and XrmInitialize
# allocated its state, so the leak shows under GLFW's function, in an unknown module:
leak:_glfwConnectX11
